### TEAM PREDICTION
### =========================================================

### 6. Team Prediction - valid
POST http://localhost:5000/api/team/predict
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "team": "FNATIC",
  "map": "Abyss",
  "year": 2024,
  "agents": [
    "cypher",
    "jett",
    "kayo",
    "omen",
    "sova"
  ]
}

