### =========================================================
### METHOD TESTING
### =========================================================

### 1. Wrong method - General Analysis
GET http://localhost:5000/api/general/analyze
Accept: application/json

# expected
# <!doctype html>
# <html lang=en>
# <title>405 Method Not Allowed</title>
# <h1>Method Not Allowed</h1>
# <p>The method is not allowed for the requested URL.</p>


###

### 2. Wrong method - Team Prediction
GET http://localhost:5000/api/team/predict
Accept: application/json

# expected
# <!doctype html>
# <html lang=en>
# <title>405 Method Not Allowed</title>
# <h1>Method Not Allowed</h1>
# <p>The method is not allowed for the requested URL.</p>


###

### 3. Unknown endpoint
GET http://localhost:5000/api/unknown
Accept: application/json

# expected
# <!doctype html>
# <html lang=en>
# <title>404 Not Found</title>
# <h1>Not Found</h1>
# <p>The requested URL was not found on the server. If you entered the URL manually please check your spelling and try again.</p>

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### EXPECTED HTTP STATUS
### ------------------------------------------------------------
# Shared years                         -> 200
# Shared maps                         -> 200
# Missing/invalid query parameter     -> 400
# Team options                        -> 200
# General valid request               -> 200
# General invalid request             -> 400
# Team prediction valid request       -> 200
# Team prediction invalid request     -> 400
# Unexpected server exception         -> 500
